The policy reading has two layers.

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:22.960
In Europe, data sovereignty is a rising theme, and Intric's pitch of Swedish

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.700
servers with no foreign cloud is aimed straight at it.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.240
In the US, the DeepSeek order is explicitly about the vendor's country.

